# PHPDoc Documentation (Javadoc-style)

Document all public classes and public/protected methods with PHPDoc blocks. Use the same style as Java Javadoc: summary, @param, @return, @throws when applicable.

## Class-level

```php
/**
 * Handles order status transitions and validation.
 *
 * Ensures only allowed status changes are applied and dispatches
 * SourcingOrderStatusChanged when the status is updated.
 */
class OrderStatusService implements OrderStatusServiceInterface
{
```

## Method-level (public / protected)

```php
